-Uniformly-Discrete-Metric-Space-September-26-2026.html#cor:renorming","release_id":"openai-math","schema":"statement-map-web/2","section":1,"section_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:94a31f2cd216a1778af8b80098ac6e77ddd27bb46afd3f594ba171dd13103412","file":"preprints/Failure-of-Bounded-Approximation-in-a-Lipschitz-Free-Space-over-a-Uniformly-Discrete-Metric-Space-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex","line":119,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2f16812387590ae48b5d8692bac568aaa2fe93a36432db1974a84825790291d5","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Failure-of-Bounded-Approximation-in-a-Lipschitz-Free-Space-over-a-Uniformly-Discrete-Metric-Space-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:94a31f2cd216a1778af8b80098ac6e77ddd27bb46afd3f594ba171dd13103412","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Failure-of-Bounded-Approximation-in-a-Lipschitz-Free-Space-over-a-Uniformly-Discrete-Metric-Space-September-26-2026/build/sections/introduction.tex#L119"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:renorming}\nFor each integer $p\\ge1$, real $\\ell_1$ has an equivalent norm\n$\\norm{\\cdot}_p$ such that\n\\[\n \\tfrac12\\norm{c}_1\\le\\norm{c}_p\\le B_p\\norm{c}_1,\n\\]\nand $(\\ell_1,\\norm{\\cdot}_p)$ has $2B_p$-BAP but fails $p$-BAP.\nFor $p=1$, this norm fails MAP."}
